{
  "description": "The architecture findings of this project (scope project, default) or between the services of its workspaces (scope workspace), read from the files now: kind, level, basis (fact, or heuristic: read from names or thresholds), title, why, what could help, evidence (file:line), status since the last change (new, changed, unchanged, gone) and the author's mark (by design with the reason, back for review, or a task); a boundary finding names the recorded rule it breaks. Boundary rules are knowledge: lines such as 'group Domain = *.Domain', 'layers: Api > BL > DAL', 'forbid: Domain -> *.DAL', 'only: Application -> Domain' in a constraint, decision or convention (propose new ones with memory_propose). Drift (a broken rule, or knowledge naming code that is gone: stale-knowledge) can be resolved either way: propose a corrected statement with memory_propose (supersedes = the rule's memory) or a task fixing the code with architecture_propose. Without a filter the answer is a summary by kind and one line per finding; filter by kind or area (a path prefix; for workspace findings also a member's name), or give a key, for findings in full (why, what could help, every place). Explain and suggest; never act on a finding until it is a task. Architectural tasks and by-design marks are the author's: propose them to the user, never create them. A finding marked by design is intended (its reason says why): do not raise it again; one back for review grew since it was marked.",
  "inputSchema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "scope": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "project (default) or workspace: the system findings between the services of this project's workspaces"
      },
      "key": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "one finding in full, by its key"
      },
      "full": {
        "type": "boolean",
        "description": "every finding in full (by default, without a kind, area or key filter, a summary and one short line each)"
      },
      "area": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "only findings about this path prefix (the unit or any evidence); for workspace findings also a member's name"
      },
      "kind": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "only this kind, e.g. cycle, layering, unused, deep-import, chatty, contract-unserved, shared-database"
      },
      "hide_marked": {
        "type": "boolean",
        "description": "leave out findings the author marked by design (by default they are listed with the reason)"
      },
      "gone": {
        "type": "boolean",
        "description": "also list findings gone since the last change (a task's shows it resolved)"
      },
      "snippets": {
        "type": "boolean",
        "description": "also the code at each listed finding's evidence (the function it names, a repeated run, lines around a line), within a size budget: to judge whether a finding is real"
      }
    },
    "additionalProperties": false
  },
